nnel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "why": "This is a constraint on SMEFT Wilson coefficients affecting VH production and H→bb decay, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:model-independent-upper-limit", "why": "This is an upper limit on BSM cross section and signal event yield, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not a specific signal strength modifier for the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for ttbar normalization, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZZ", "why": "This is a different observable related to the ZZ→4b signal strength, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "why": "This is a signal strength for ggHH production, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZH", "why": "This is a signal strength for ZH production with a specific decay channel, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential production cross section, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tan_alpha", "why": "This is a CP-mixing angle, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "why": "This is about the branching fraction to invisible final states, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-fiducial", "why": "This is a fiducial production cross section with specific kinematic cuts, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:spin-correlation-fSM", "why": "This is a spin-correlation strength parameter for t-tbar-Z, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "why": "This is a signal acceptance times effic