action, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:wz-total-xsec", "why": "This is a total cross section but for pp->WZ, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-wc-particle-inclusive", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for W+c production, not related to Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ratio_el_tot", "why": "This is a ratio of elastic to total cross section, not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-wc-parton-inclusive", "why": "Fiducial cross section for W+c, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:hh_incl_signal_strength", "why": "This is a signal strength for HH production, not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_pt_h", "why": "This is a differential cross-section as a function of Higgs boson transverse momentum, not the total Higgs production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_z", "why": "This is a total cross section times branching fraction for Z, not related to Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wplus", "why": "This is a total cross section but for W+, not Higgs boson."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-inclusive-xsec", "why": "Inclusive t-tbar-W production cross section, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff_xsec_y_h", "why": "Measures a differential cross section, not the total."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_wminus", "why": "Cross section for W- times branching fraction, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is about coupling modifiers and total width, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_xsec_w", "why": "This is a product of a cross section and a branching fraction, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "This is a total cross section but for inelastic processes, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "Measures the inclusive cross section for t-tbar-W-, not the total Higgs cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is a cross section for a different process, not the total Higgs cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_stxs0_cross_section_times_bzz", "why": "STXS stage 0 production cross section times H->ZZ branching fraction, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wz", "why": "Measures the total cross section ratio of W to Z, not the total Higgs cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_production", "why": "Signal strength modifier is related but not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "why": "This is a ratio of W cross sections, not related to Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-fiducial-xsec", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process, not the total Higgs cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:rc-ratio-inclusive", "why": "Measures the cross section ratio of W+ and W-, not the total Higgs cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-inclusive-hgg", "why": "Measures the signal strength modifier for a specific decay channel, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_stxs12_cross_section_times_bzz", "why": "Measures a differential cross section times branching fraction, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_inclusive", "why": "Signal strength modifier for H->gamma gamma, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:signal-strength-mu", "why": "Measures the global signal strength modifier, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_el_obs", "why": "This is a total elastic cross section, not the total Higgs boson production cross section