vable:mu_per_mode", "why": "Signal strength modifiers for Higgs production modes, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:stxs-xsec", "why": "This is a differential cross section, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-h-inclusive", "why": "Signal strength is related but not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:vhh_signal_strength", "why": "Signal strength for VHH production, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:diff-xsec-pt-z", "why": "Differential WZ cross section, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fiducial_xsec_inclusive", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section, not the total production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_prod_decay", "why": "Measures the signal strength modifier per production process and decay channel, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_inclusive", "why": "Measures the inclusive signal strength modifier, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:R_b_over_j", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections for Z+b jets to Z+jets, not the total Higgs boson production cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:R_c_over_j", "why": "Ratio of Z+c jets to Z+jets cross sections, not total Higgs production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_z", "why": "This is a ratio of Z cross sections, not related to Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_wminus", "why": "This is about W- cross sections, not Higgs boson production."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_wplus", "why": "This is a ratio of cross sections, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "Measures the ratio of Higgs boson coupling modifiers, not the total cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:stxs_stage0_xsec", "why": "This is a production-bin cross section times branching fraction, not the total production cross section