{"run_id": "20260815T104348-hepkg-48526", "qid": "gen-concept-29d71b2f", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "76ac05498582", "git_sha": "b6ce7b2-dirty", "question": "Count the analyses that used the sample V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1).", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 15 distinct analyses that used the sample \"V+jets (QCD/EW) simulation sample (Sherpa 2.2.1)\". Here are some examples of the papers and their corresponding quotes:\n\n1. **Paper**: \"Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using \\(H \\rightarrow b\\bar{b}\\) decays in the ATLAS detector\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The V+jets (W→qq, Z→qq) hadronic MC sample is used.\"\n\n2. **Paper**: \"Evidence for the charge asymmetry in \\(pp \\rightarrow t\\bar{t}\\) production at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The \\(V{+}\\text{jets}\\) (\\(W\\) or \\(Z\\) boson) MC sample (Sherpa 2.2.1) is used.\"\n\n3. **Paper**: \"General search for supersymmetric particles in scenarios with compressed mass spectra using proton-proton collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\, \\text{Te\\hskip-0.80002ptV}\\)\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The W+jets background MC sample is used.\"\n\n4. **Paper**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of \\(t\\bar{t}Z\\) production in \\(pp\\) collisions at \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\) TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The nominal \\(V\\) sample (Sherpa 2.2.1) is used.\"\n\n5. **Paper**: \"Inclusive and differential cross-sections for dilepton \\(t\\bar{t}\\) production measured in \\(\\sqrt{s}=13\\;\\) TeV \\(pp\\) collisions with the ATLAS detector\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The \\(Z( \\to \\tau\\tau)\\)+jets Sherpa 2.2.1 sample is used.\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The \\(Z( \\to ee)\\)+jets Sherpa 2.2.1 control sample is used.\"\n   - **Quote**: \"The \\(Z( \\to \\mu\\mu)\\)+jets S