ility of differential Higgs boson signal strengths, which is not directly the signal strength modifier for H→γγ decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "This is a ratio of coupling modifiers, not a signal strength modifier measurement."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zh", "why": "This is a specific observable for ZH production, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for VZ, Z→bb production, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "why": "This is about the invisible branching fraction of the Higgs boson, which is not related to the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for ttbar normalization, which is unrelated to the H→γγ decay signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mbb-spectrum", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution for a dark Higgs boson candidate, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_tH", "why": "This is a signal strength for tH production, not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on couplings, not a signal strength modifier measurement."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "why": "This is a broad constraint on a large set of parameters in the SMEFT model, which is not directly related to the specific signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zprime-hgamma-hbb", "why": "This is a cross-section and branching fraction measurement for a different process, not related to the Higgs boson signal strength modifier for the H→γγ decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-HH", "why": "This is a general signal strength for HH production, which is not the inclusive signal strength 