entification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:trigger-lepton-efficiency", "why": "This is about trigger and lepton reconstruction/identification efficiency uncertainty, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jet_selection_efficiency", "why": "This is about jet selection efficiency, not pileup jet identification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jet_flavor_tagging", "why": "This is about jet flavor tagging calibration, not pileup jet identification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jetpt-regression-scale-resolution", "why": "Relates to jet pT regression scale/resolution, which is unrelated to pileup jet identification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:lepton_tauh_id_efficiency", "why": "This is about muon, electron, and tau_h identification efficiency, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jet-energy-scale-resolution-uncertainty", "why": "This is about jet energy scale and resolution uncertainty, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:gluon_splitting", "why": "This is about gluon splitting rate uncertainty, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:electron-identification-ccent", "why": "This is an electron identification uncertainty, not a pileup jet misidentification rate uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jes-jer", "why": "This is about jet energy scale and resolution, not pileup jet identification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:tau_h_id_efficiency", "why": "This is about hadronic tau identification efficiency, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:photon-identification-efficiency", "why": "This is a photon identification efficiency uncertainty, not a pileup jet misidentification rate uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jms", "why": "This is about jet mass scale uncertainty, not pileup jet misidentification."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:jvt_efficiency", "why": "This is a jet vertex tagger efficiency uncertainty, not a pileup jet misidentification rate uncertainty