r for inclusive HH production, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-fiducial-validation", "why": "This is a signal strength validation for Z->bb, not specifically for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_by_production_mode", "why": "This is a set of signal strength modifiers for various production modes, not specifically for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for VH production with a specific decay channel, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:kappa-lambda", "why": "This is a trilinear self-coupling modifier, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_wh_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for WH production with a specific decay channel, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_zh_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for ZH production, not specifically for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "This is a different observable related to Higgs boson couplings and total width, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "why": "This is a different observable related to resolved Higgs boson coupling modifiers, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for VZ, Z→bb, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:p-value-mu-h-compatibility", "why": "This is a p-value for the compatibility of differential signal strengths, not the specific H→WW modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:vhh_signal_strength", "why": "This is a signal strength for VHH production, not specifically for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:hh_vbf_signal_strength", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for VBF HH production, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:br_h_to_inv", "why": "This is a different observable related to the Higgs boson invisible branching fraction, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mbb-spectrum", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution for a dark Higgs boson candidate, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "This is a different observable related to ratios of Higgs boson coupling modifiers, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vh_bb_dijetmass", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for VH production and H→bb decay, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_ttH", "why": "This is a signal strength for t-tbar-H production, not specifically for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_tH", "why": "This is a signal strength for tH production, not specifically for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-HH", "why": "This is a signal strength but for HH production, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "why": "This is a branching fraction ratio, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_with_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not a specific signal strength modifier for the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:pt_h", "why": "This is a different observable, not related to the Higgs boson signal strength modifier."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_quadratic", "why": "This is a different observable related to constraints on the SMEFT fit basis, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:higgs_br_ul", "why": "This is an upper limit on a branching fraction, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_tot", "why": "This is a total production cross section, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:eft_coefficient_constraints", "why": "This is a constraint on SMEFT Wilson coefficients affecting VH production and H→bb decay, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:model-independent-upper-limit", "why": "This is an upper limit on BSM cross section and signal event yield, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:fit_basis_linear_no_dihiggs", "why": "This is a constraint on the SMEFT fit basis, not a specific signal strength modifier for the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ttbar-inclusive", "why": "This is a signal strength modifier for ttbar normalization, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZZ", "why": "This is a different observable related to the ZZ→4b signal strength, not the signal strength modifier for WW decay."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ggHH", "why": "This is a signal strength for ggHH production, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-ZH", "why": "This is a signal strength for ZH production with a specific decay channel, not the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-differential", "why": "This is a differential production cross section, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tan_alpha", "why": "This is a CP-mixing angle, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:bsm_branching_fraction_invisible", "why": "This is about the branching fraction to invisible final states, not the WW decay mode."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-fiducial", "why": "This is a fiducial production cross section with specific kinematic cuts, not a signal strength modifier for the WW decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:spin-correlation-fSM", "why": "This is a spin-correlation strength parameter for t-tbar-Z, not a signal strength modifier for H→WW."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "why": "This is a signal acceptance times effic