ifferential distribution of $Z$ boson mass, not related to $t\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\text{T}}^{Z}$."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:dphi_ttbar", "why": "This is a kinematic distribution but for a different observable (azimuthal angle difference between t and tbar)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-minus-xsec", "why": "This is an inclusive cross section for a different process (ttW-)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:ttw-plus-xsec", "why": "This is an inclusive cross section for a different process (t tbar W+)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-ul-ttbar-95cl", "why": "Upper limit on $T$ quark pair production, not related to $t\bar{t}Z$ cross section vs $p_{\text{T}}^{Z}$."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:sigma_inel", "why": "Total inelastic cross section is not related to the differential $t\bar{t}Z$ cross section."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_ratio_wpm", "why": "Ratio of total cross sections for $W+$ and $W-$, not related to $t\bar{t}Z$."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:tot_enratio_z", "why": "This is a ratio of total Z cross sections at different energies, not for $t\\bar{t}Z$ and not vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{Z}$."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:zpt-ll-ut-compatibility", "why": "This is a comparison of Z boson transverse momentum spectra, not a differential cross section measurement."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:acceptance_efficiency", "why": "This is a differential observable related to a hypothetical Z' boson, not for $t\\bar{t}Z$ and not vs $p_{\\text{T}}^{Z}$."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:njet012_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "why": "Measures a differential cross section but for a different set of observables."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:wz-fiducial-xsec", "why": "This is a fiducial cross section for a different process (WZ production)."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:njet0123_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "why": "This is a triple-differential cross section for ttW, not ttZ, and involves different kinematic variables."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:lepton-flavor-ratio", "why": "Ratio of differen